<title>FRANCE: Rouen June 1-25 grain exports at 412,410 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen June 1-25 grain exports at 412,410 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 412,410 tonnes between June 1 and June 25, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Total grain exports were 181,000 tonnes for the whole of June 1996.</p>
<p>The June 1-25 total included 339,332 tonnes of wheat and 73,078 tonnes of barley destined for Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following wheat breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   42,430</p>
<p>    Algeria			 23,243</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		15,000</p>
<p>    Chile			    4,140</p>
<p>    Cuba			    48,394</p>
<p>    Spain			    5,173</p>
<p>    Britain			 11,031</p>
<p>    Iraq			    24,000</p>
<p>    Ireland			  1,480</p>
<p>    Italy			  120,391</p>
<p>    Turkey			  44,050</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
